    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG O'Sullivan Hurley are delighted to welcome this top floor apartment to the market for sale by private treaty. No 25 is a two bedroom apartment set in the popular Boheraroan development located within walking distance of all services and amenities in Newmarket on Fergus village and easy access within minutes' drive onto the M18 motorway for those commuting to Ennis, Shannon and Limerick. The property is presented in very good decorative order throughout with large open plan kitchen/living/dining area to the front with an abundance of natural light. There are two fantastic large bedrooms and main bathroom completing the internal accommodation. The property enjoys access to a large communal green and parking areas within the development which overlooks Lough Gash in Newmarket on Fergus. This is an ideal investor or owner occupier property and viewings are highly recommended and strictly by prior appointment with sole selling agents. PSL 002295"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - \nCarpeted flooring, hotpress storage closet, coved ceiling and access to large attic.\n\nKitchen/Living/Dining - 6.6m x 6.5m\n(L-shaped) Kitchen area built in wall and floor units, tiled splashback, integrated electric hob, oven and overhead extractor fan, tiled flooring and space and plumbing for dishwasher, washing machine and fridge freezer. Living/Dining area solid oak timber flooring, three front aspect windows, ceiling spotlights and ceiling coving.\n\nBedroom One - 5.3m x 3.6m\nCarpeted flooring, ceiling spotlights, coved ceiling and rear aspect window.\n\nBedroom Two - 4.7m x 2.8m\nCarpeted flooring, ceiling spotlights, coved ceiling and rear aspect window.\n\nBathroom - 2.4m x 1.7m\nFully tiled, ceiling spotlights, coved ceiling, WC, wash hand basin with overhead wall mounted mirror and light, bath with side bath screen and overhead rainfall shower attachment.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Eircode V95HH3</li><li> Total Floor Space 84.17 m2</li><li> Built 2006</li><li> Mains Water</li><li> Mains Sewage</li><li> Electric Heating</li><li> Fibre Broadband</li><li> Communal Parking and Green Areas</ul>"
      },
